---
import Slide from '../ui/Slide.astro';
import Callout from '../ui/Callout.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../ui/CodeBlock.astro';
import Pill from '../ui/Pill.astro';
---

<Slide
  id="s24b-layer-networking-commands"
  chapter="Layers"
  title="Networking — Commands"
  notes="Path verification: svc/endpoints, netshoot debug pod for nslookup and curl, netpol, ingress/gateway. Myth: Service exists so traffic flows — without ready endpoints it's an empty shell."
>
  <div class="stagger flex flex-col gap-6">
    <section>
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-deck-cyan">Typical commands</h3>
      <CodeBlock
        lang="bash"
        caption="Path verification"
        code={`kubectl get svc,endpoints -n <ns>
kubectl run dbg --rm -it --image=nicolaka/netshoot -- bash
# inside: nslookup my-svc.my-ns.svc.cluster.local
# inside: curl -v http://my-svc:8080/health
kubectl describe netpol -n <ns>
kubectl get ingress,gateway -A`}
      />
    </section>

    <Callout type="myth">
      A Service exists so traffic flows. Without ready endpoints and matching selectors, the Service is an empty shell.
    </Callout>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-t border-deck-border/60 pt-4">
      <Pill tone="amber">Decision hint</Pill>
      <span class="text-lg text-deck-muted">Walk the onion outside-in: DNS → endpoints → policy → route.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</Slide>
